            <title>[IGNITE-15621] Flaky test MultifieldIndexQueryTest.testCheckBoundaries</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15621</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Params: nodesCnt=2, qryIdx=null&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failed line: assertEquals(2, result.size());&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It expect 2 but get 3. Looks like some miss of condition, we check inline in moment of put is writing this inline (so first field is OK, and second is not ready yet)&lt;/p&gt;

